title: SCP-231
subtitle: Requesting Class-D personnels
tags: event
view-if: month = 7 and year = 2000 and half = 2
priority: 1
max-visits: 1

Site-19 is requesting other sites for class-d personnels for the 110-Montauk Procedure to keep SCP-231-7 contained, because their current class-d personnels aren't qualified enough for the sensitive procedure and poses great risk for a containment breach to occur.

should we propose our class-ds?
  
- @propose: They could use some of our class-ds.
- @perhaps: Perhaps we could renew the 110-Montauk Procedure?
- @no: We either can't or don't want to help them right now.

@no

@propose
subtitle: -2 resources, and -20 class_ds
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
choose-if: resources >= 2
on-arrival: class_d -= 0.02; resources -= 2

@perhaps
view-if: scidep_funds >= 5
